titanic supernova explosion.

00:07:11.020 --> 00:07:13.482
- Damn you, iron!
- It is be--

00:07:13.482 --> 00:07:15.025
(laughs)

00:07:15.025 --> 00:07:15.858
- Cool.

00:07:15.858 --> 00:07:16.691
Cool!

00:07:16.691 --> 00:07:19.491
- You blew it up!
- You blew it up!

00:07:19.491 --> 00:07:20.576
You did it!

00:07:20.576 --> 00:07:22.659
(laughs)

00:07:23.590 --> 00:07:26.790
- Iron is this magic place on
the periodic table of elements

00:07:26.790 --> 00:07:28.780
